    "<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">這裡安排三道數值題與一道綜合觀念題。數值題可以直接輸入答案並檢查，綜合題則需要自己組織推理。</p>\n<div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" data-d-has-border=\"\" style=\"border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-xl); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"between\"><h2 class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Title-ij922C\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"title\" data-d-size=\"lg\" data-d-weight=\"semibold\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">章末數值挑戰</strong></h2><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"xs\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary);\">每題 1 分，共 3 分</p></div><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"sm\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary);\">可以使用 <span class=\"Math-c_BmHA\" data-d-component=\"math\" dir=\"ltr\">(E_n=-13.6/n^2\\ \\mathrm{eV})</span> 及 <span class=\"Math-c_BmHA\" data-d-component=\"math\" dir=\"ltr\">(E(\\mathrm{eV})\\approx1240/\\lambda(\\mathrm{nm}))</span>。輸入數字即可，最後一次批改。</p><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\"><span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">第 1 題｜激發所需能量</strong></span></p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">一個原本處於基態 <span class=\"Math-c_BmHA\" data-d-component=\"math\" dir=\"ltr\">(n=1)</span> 的氫原子，吸收一個光子後直接躍遷至 <span class=\"Math-c_BmHA\" data-d-component=\"math\" dir=\"ltr\">(n=4)</span>。</p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">該光子至少需具有多少 eV 的能量，才能完成這次指定的躍遷？</p><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"flex: 1 1 0%;\"><div class=\"Container-PpxXyQ\" data-w-component=\"\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"xl\" data-focused=\"false\" data-pill=\"\">",
    "<input data-d-component=\"input\" placeholder=\"輸入數值\" id=\"_r_dp_\" class=\"Input-S5bfLR\" data-lpignore=\"true\" data-1p-ignore=\"true\" type=\"text\" value=\"\"></div></div><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary);\">eV</p></div></div><div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\"><span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">第 2 題｜放光波長</strong></span></p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">延續第 1 題，假設電子後來直接由 <span class=\"Math-c_BmHA\" data-d-component=\"math\" dir=\"ltr\">(n=4)</span> 下降至 <span class=\"Math-c_BmHA\" data-d-component=\"math\" dir=\"ltr\">(n=2)</span>。</p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">計算放出光子的波長，並將答案四捨五入至整數 nm。</p><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"flex: 1 1 0%;\"><div class=\"Container-PpxXyQ\" data-w-component=\"\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"xl\" data-focused=\"false\" data-pill=\"\"><input data-d-component=\"input\" placeholder=\"輸入數值\" id=\"_r_du_\" class=\"Input-S5bfLR\" data-lpignore=\"true\" data-1p-ignore=\"true\" type=\"text\" value=\"\"></div></div><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary);\">nm</p></div></div><div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\"><span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">第 3 題｜游離與剩餘動能</strong></span></p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">一個氫原子的電子原本處於 <span class=\"Math-c_BmHA\" data-d-component=\"math\" dir=\"ltr\">(n=2)</span>。原子吸收一個能量為 4.00 eV 的光子後，電子脫離原子核的束縛。</p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">忽略原子核反沖，電子脫離後具有多少 eV 的動能？</p>",
    "<div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"flex: 1 1 0%;\"><div class=\"Container-PpxXyQ\" data-w-component=\"\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"xl\" data-focused=\"false\" data-pill=\"\"><input data-d-component=\"input\" placeholder=\"輸入數值\" id=\"_r_e3_\" class=\"Input-S5bfLR\" data-lpignore=\"true\" data-1p-ignore=\"true\" type=\"text\" value=\"\"></div></div><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary);\">eV</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"primary\" data-variant=\"solid\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"lg\" data-block=\"\" disabled=\"\" aria-disabled=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-disabled=\"\" data-d-component=\"button\" data-d-block=\"\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\">提交並批改 3 題</span></button></div>\n<h3 class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Title-ij922C\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"title\" data-d-size=\"md\" data-d-weight=\"semibold\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">第 4 題｜綜合觀念與推理</strong></h3>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">有一群氫原子，起初全部處於 <span class=\"Math-c_BmHA\" data-d-component=\"math\" dir=\"ltr\">(n=4)</span> 的激發態。</p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">若這群原子在返回基態的過程中，各種允許的向下躍遷都有機會發生，並假設每次躍遷產生一個光子：</p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\"><span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">(a)</strong></span> 這群原子最多可能出現幾種不同波長的發射譜線？請列出所有對應的能階躍遷。</p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\"><span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">(b)</strong></span> 單獨一個原子，若從 <span class=\"Math-c_BmHA\" data-d-component=\"math\" dir=\"ltr\">(n=4)</span> 返回 <span class=\"Math-c_BmHA\" data-d-component=\"math\" dir=\"ltr\">(n=1)</span>，是否能在這一次返回過程中發出上述所有種類的光譜線？說明原因。</p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\"><span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">(c)</strong></span> 在所有可能的發射譜線中，哪一種躍遷對應的光子能量最大？哪一種波長最長？請從能階差解釋，而非只憑 <span class=\"Math-c_BmHA\" data-d-component=\"math\" dir=\"ltr\">(n)</span> 的大小猜測。</p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">這一題特別檢查你是否真正理解：光譜線數量、單一電子的躍遷路徑，以及能階差與波長之間的關係。</p>",
    "\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">本章最重要的學習成果，不是只記住 <span class=\"Math-c_BmHA\" data-d-component=\"math\" dir=\"ltr\">(E_n=-13.6/n^2)</span>，而是能夠利用它解釋<span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">為何原子會產生離散光譜、如何計算電子躍遷的能量，以及波耳模型與現代量子模型的根本差異</strong></span>。</p>"
  ],
